  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Apoyo al Sistema de Justicia Penal</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for the Criminal Justice System</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general del programa es contribuir a reducir la elevada concentracin de poblacin penitenciaria en Guyana. Los objetivos especficos son (i) reducir la proporcin de presos en detencin preventiva, y (ii) aumentar el uso de sentencias alternativas en el pas.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the programme is to contribute to the reduction of high concentrations of prison population in Guyana. The specific objectives are: (i) to reduce the proportion of inmates who are pre-trial detainees; and (ii) to increase the use of alternative sentencing in the country.</narrative>
  </description>
